WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
That boss

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,720
I want to give you a shoulder massage. No need.

3
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:05,960
Go and look around

4
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:10,590
Don't let the monsters get close

5
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:16,420
It's surprisingly comfortable

6
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:21,240
Be back immediately, boss

7
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:23,040
Our harvest this time has been extremely rich

8
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,360
Killed several hexagons

9
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:28,850
Several treasure chests were discovered, and there's also a boss there.

10
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:37,420
You lost the boss

11
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:40,360
This is too cautious, right?

12
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:44,060
Even his own people are so guarded

13
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:46,770
Seven treasure chests are good

14
00:00:46,770 --> 00:00:49,640
I'll give you fourteen gold coins, boss.

15
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:51,120
I just heard that group of robbers say
